/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 76 0 R
/T (In this empirical section, we focus on the practical application of data analysis methods and Machine Learning to study the phenomenon of hotel booking cancellations. This is a binary supervised classification study whose main objective is to predict the binary target variable "canceled booking" \(1 if canceled, 0 otherwise\), while identifying the most influential factors driving this decision.)
/E (In this empirical section, we focus on the practical application of data analysis methods and Machine Learning to study the phenomenon of hotel booking cancellations. This is a binary supervised classification study whose main objective is to predict the binary target variable "canceled booking" \(1 if canceled, 0 otherwise\), while identifying the most influential factors driving this decision.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
